@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>

hpc:Slurm a owl:Class.
hpc:Mvapich2 a owl:Class.

hpc:usesslurm a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:usespmi a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:bootstrap a owl:ObjectProperty.

hpc:SlurmBootstrap a owl:Enum.
hpc:SlurmBootstrap a hpc:PMI; rdfs:member "srun".
hpc:SlurmBootstrap a hpc:PMI; rdfs:member "ssh".

hpc:PMI a owl:Enum.
hpc:PMI a hpc:SlurmBootstrap; r
